\u9898\u3002","readme_en":"1. Changed the device name to [8BitDo Pro 2 Wired Controller].\r\n2. Fixed the abnormal issue when press the Start button while using joysticks.\r\n3. Fixed the no turbo inputs problem(L2 & R2 buttons) when activate the custom profile.\r\n4. Fixed the problem that joystick cannot reach the maximum analog value after using the Ultimate Software to adjust the outer maximum range of joystick.","beta":0,"md5":"CA7515543231D397BC9E62654BE4059F"},{"created_at":"2022-03-09","fileName":"Pro2 Wired","firmware_type":37,"firmware_key":"1632","file_version":"1.02","ic_version":"","fileSize":61468,"fileURL":"https:\/\/support.8bitdo.com\/bd-uploads\/files\/old\/0fd2a631-c32d-42a0-bf40-65858a74037c.dat","exists":true,"readme":"1. \u51fa\u5382\u56fa\u4ef6","readme_en":"1. Factory firmware","beta":0,"md5":"D7B845942FB4D059F4439481F74924C2"}]}